    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread-safe registry that maps step plugin names to instances. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Built-in steps are registered at startup by <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_workflow_engine" kindref="compound">WorkflowEngine</ref></computeroutput>. Dynamic steps (<computeroutput>.so</computeroutput> / <computeroutput>.dll</computeroutput>) are loaded on demand via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_step_registry_1ad76d421bb748f93cd4f4ba3fab66f95d" kindref="member">loadStepPlugin()</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para>Naming convention: <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1ingestion_1_1builtin" kindref="compound">builtin</ref>.&lt;name&gt;</computeroutput> for bundled steps, <computeroutput>&lt;vendor&gt;.&lt;name&gt;</computeroutput> for third-party plugins. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
